+// first paint the limit allows, nothing waits for a phase, and a game at or below the limit is
+// shown as before (at most one refresh later, never dropped by the limit). The summary line also
+// says which drops were the limit's, the game's own times between pictures, the present times
+// and the longest time a picture stayed, for the next console test.
